      "content_sha256": "ce86c3ddb64d3705c5a6beb76548c938c9e40ed2b9f3ad3dfc61bb1a3dd5b6de"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Since $ \\mathbf{G}^{-1} = \\sigma_A^{-2} \\mathbf{A}^{-1} $, the mixed-model equations (Equation 26.5) for the animal model reduce to",
